# Supabase MCP

- For anything Supabase-related (SQL, schema, RLS, migrations, advisors, logs, types), use the project Supabase MCP yourself.
- Do not ask the user to run SQL or apply migrations manually unless MCP cannot do it.
- If MCP cannot complete a step, say exactly what failed and what is blocked.
- Prefer `list_tables` / existing schema before inventing tables.
- After schema changes, check advisors when relevant (RLS, security).
